@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #344054
skinparam maxMessageSize 300
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #344054
  FontColor #101828
}
skinparam package {
  BorderColor #667085
  FontColor #101828
  BackgroundColor #F9FAFB
}
title Behavior - Edit a lead
actor "Administrator" as actor
box "Frontend - Mission Control application" #E0F2FE
  participant "LeadFormDialog / LeadForm" as page
  participant "ILeadService / LeadService" as client
end box
box "Backend - MissionControl.Api" #D1FADF
  participant "CurrentAccountAuthorization" as access
  participant "LeadsController" as ctrl
end box
box "Backend - MissionControl.Application and Domain" #ECFDF3
  participant "ValidationBehavior" as validation
  participant "UpdateLeadCommandHandler" as handler
  participant "LeadContact" as entity
end box
box "Backend - MissionControl.Infrastructure" #FFF4E5
  database "Mission Control SQL" as db
end box
actor -> page : Edit a lead (shown only with leads.manage); LeadFormDialog opens; fields and Save disabled; announce "Loading lead"
page -> client : LeadForm's leadResource reads GetLeadQuery (GET /api/leads/{id}, authorized like any contact read)
alt Read 404 (lead deleted after the list or details loaded)
  client --> page : Resource status error (404)
  page --> actor : edit-not-found: fields and Save stay disabled; alert "This lead no longer exists" is announced; focus Back to leads; no reference ID or Try again
  actor -> page : Back to leads
  page -> page : LeadForm emits notFound; the dialog closes with NotFound; LeadDirectoryPage increments refresh, or LeadDetailPage navigates to /leads, which reads afresh
else Read fails (500 with correlation ID, or no response)
  client --> page : Resource status error
  page --> actor : edit-load-failed: fields and Save stay disabled; alert announced, with the reference ID for a 500 (no response: none, and the shell's offline banner appears); focus Try again, which calls reload(); Cancel closes
else Read resolves
  client --> page : LeadDetailResult with its version; the draft starts from it; focus First name
end
note right of page
  Only a resolved read continues below.
end note
actor -> page : Change lead details and save
page -> page : Disable repeat submission; show saving progress; draftChange reports dirty and pending
page -> client : edit(UpdateLeadCommand with the opened expectedVersion) returns a promise
client -> access : PUT /api/leads/{id}
access -> access : L2-002 validate signature, issuer, audience, subject, expiry
access -> db : Read current status, role and credential version
db --> access : Current account access
alt Missing, invalid, or expired JWT; inactive account
  access --> client : 401; audit denial without payloads
  client -> client : sessionInterceptor: a 401 for the current session generation calls SessionService.end(Unauthorized) once
  client --> page : The promise rejects with the 401; sign-in explains edits were not saved (L2-003.4)
else Collaborator (no contact mutation in profile P)
  access --> client : 403; audit denial without payloads
  client -> client : sessionInterceptor calls SessionService.refreshCapabilities() (one in flight)
  client --> page : The promise rejects with the 403; forbidden state: keep the dialog and every value; show that only administrators can edit leads; Save changes unavailable, so focus moves to the alert; no reference ID; nothing saved; controls follow currentSession
else Administrator
  access -> ctrl : Authorized request
ctrl -> validation : Send UpdateLeadCommand through MediatR 12.5.0
validation -> validation : L2-009 trim; field limits, valid email, known category
alt Invalid request
  validation --> ctrl : 400 field errors; no business mutation
  ctrl --> client : Validation ProblemDetails
  client --> page : The promise rejects; keep valid input; no Retry or reference ID; one field error focuses that field, which reads its error; several focus the linked error summary
else Valid request
  validation -> handler : Handle UpdateLeadCommand
  handler -> db : LoadLeadAsync: lead by ID
  db --> handler : Current contact or none
  alt Lead missing or deleted
    handler --> ctrl : 404; nothing changed
    ctrl --> client : NotFound ProblemDetails
    client --> page : The promise rejects; deleted state: keep the attempted values; disable fields and Save; announce the alert; focus Back to leads; no reference ID or Try again; Back to leads emits notFound; the dialog closes with NotFound; the directory reloads, or the detail page navigates to /leads
  else Stored version differs from expectedVersion
    handler --> ctrl : 409 stale version; nothing changed
    ctrl --> client : Conflict ProblemDetails
    client --> page : The promise rejects with the stale 409
    page -> client : LeadForm calls reload() on its lead resource once (GET /api/leads/{id}, authorized as above)
    client --> page : Resource resolves with the latest saved values and version
    page -> page : Keep attempted values; show Your edit vs Latest saved; Reload latest replaces Save and receives focus; announce the alert; no resubmission
    note right of page
      L2-041.3: Reload latest adopts the reloaded values
      and version without another request; the comparison
      stays visible until the edits are re-applied and saved.
    end note
  else Current version
    handler -> db : LoadLeadByEmailAndCategoryAsync: another contact with the normalized email and category
    db --> handler : Existing contact or none
    alt Pair used by another contact
      handler --> ctrl : 409 duplicate with existing contact ID, name, category; nothing changed
      ctrl --> client : Conflict ProblemDetails
      client --> page : The promise rejects; keep input; flag email and category; name and link the existing lead; focus Email, which reads its error
    else Pair available
      handler -> entity : L2-011 edit fields and category; L2-013 no account changes, even for the City contact
      entity --> handler : Updated contact
      handler -> db : L2-039 / L2-040 SaveChangesAsync: update where the tracked expectedVersion matches; append success audit; one transaction
      alt Racing save changed the version, or unique index rejects the pair
        db --> handler : Roll back update and audit
        handler --> ctrl : 409 stale version or 409 duplicate, as above
        ctrl --> client : Conflict ProblemDetails
        client --> page : Same handling as the matching 409 above
      else Commit fails unexpectedly
        db --> handler : Roll back business state and success audit
        handler --> ctrl : Generic 500 with correlation ID
        ctrl --> client : Failure; no successful-save claim
        client --> page : The promise rejects; failed state: keep input; announce the alert with the reference ID; Save changes keeps focus and retries only when pressed
      else Commit succeeds
        db --> handler : New committed version
        handler --> ctrl : 200 with SavedLeadResult (id, new version, first and last name, category)
        ctrl --> client : Success response
        client --> page : The promise resolves with SavedLeadResult; LeadForm emits saved; the dialog closes with Saved(SavedLeadResult)
        page -> page : The opening page increments refresh, so its directory or detail view reloads its resource, and shows the "Changes saved" toast naming the lead through TOAST_SERVICE
        page --> actor : Saved lead shown; focus returns to Edit
      end
    end
  end
end
end
opt No response to the save (timeout or network failure)
  client --> page : The save may have committed: keep the attempted values; the failed alert reads "We couldn't confirm whether your changes were saved" without a reference ID; LeadForm calls reload() on its lead resource once and emits unconfirmed, which the dialog relays, so the opening page increments refresh and its view rereads at once; Save changes resends only when pressed, and a save that did commit makes it meet the stale-version 409 and its comparison, headed "The latest saved version is shown beside your entries" without "Your edits haven't been saved"; a 404 from the reread or the repeat shows the deleted alert without "Your edits weren't saved"
end
note over ctrl, db
Unexpected failures return generic 500 plus correlation ID (L2-043).
Diagnostics exclude secrets and contact payloads.
end note
@enduml
